          "__seccion_1__": "Questions",
          "__seccion_2__": "I was looking at a 5510 online and dont see any hydraulic controls on the right side in the cab. It has 2 rear scvs and the seller says that they work off of the joystick control. Is this right? Correct. The first two SCVs on a 5510 are operated with the joystick. Forward-backward for the left-side coupler and left-right for right-side coupler. If there is a third SCV then there would be an additional lever to the right of the driver's seat.",
